      "id": 1,
      "text": "Pinnacle, originally called Paola, sprang up as a Great Northern Railway station where railroad workers, lumbermen, and US Forest Service employees lived.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
